    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d306">

                <pb facs="0413" n="241" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg241"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/508</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Stimson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-16T18:00:00-04:16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 16, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.45 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s March 14, 6 p.m.; my March 3, 11 a.m. Reliable information is that
                    little or no progress has been made. Idea of conference still entertained by
                    Argentina but slight activity in promoting it. Probable that project will be
                    abandoned. …</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
